<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  A leaner alternative to package.xml (which was generated by a full-org
  RETRIEVE and therefore also lists every CRM Analytics / Wave / Discovery AI
  / Tableau CRM asset the dev org happens to have installed — none of which
  is the Passport Seva Kendra app). This manifest is hand-curated to the
  actual PSK teaching app, for a stranger deploying into their own fresh org.

  It's a best-effort cut, not guaranteed dependency-complete: `sf project
  deploy start --manifest manifest/package-psk-core.xml` will tell you
  plainly if something is missing (a lookup field referencing an object not
  in this list, etc) — add the missing type/member and re-run. See
  docs/DEPLOY_YOUR_OWN.md.

  Deliberately excluded: the CRM Analytics/Wave bundle (WaveApplication,
  WaveDashboard, WaveDataflow, WaveDataset, WaveLens, WaveRecipe,
  WaveTemplateBundle, WaveXmd, AnalyticSnapshot, the DataManager_* Apex group's
  supporting Wave permission sets), Discovery AI / Einstein / CDP / MCP
  platform metadata, and the N8N Connected App (its consumer key is committed
  in this repo's git history — see docs/SETUP_ORG.md's security note — do not
  deploy it into a new org; it's not part of the PSK app anyway). Experience
  Cloud (Community/DigitalExperienceBundle/CustomSite) is also excluded from
  this automated deploy since a site needs manual domain/activation steps
  regardless of metadata deploy — see docs/DEPLOY_YOUR_OWN.md for that as a
  separate, optional, manual phase.
-->
